<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "600" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"............!"<PG>
"A presence..."<PG>
"It seems someone is in this world."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"No, the only ones who can exist in this world are I, the guide, and my guest, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama."<PG>
"Or else only someone I, the guide, have invited."<PG>
"So no one but you and I should be able to exist here, and yet―"<PG>
"............!
{PAUSE ""}
　Here it comes...!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n立木三日\r\n3\r\n500\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n立木三日\r\n3\r\n500\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体前春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "100" "B" "600" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm? What's this place?"</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花驚き.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"............!?
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE> are...!"<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体前春花驚き.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh!? You're...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　There's two of me...!?"</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
I see. So that is how it is. 
{PAUSE ""}
In this world, only I and <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama can exist."<PG>
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\いにしえの伝説.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Put the other way around, my own self, strayed in from another dimension, can exist. 
{PAUSE ""}
Which dimension's me are <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>, I wonder?"<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体前春花.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? I don't really get what you're saying..."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体前春花笑顔.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, well, I get it, this is a dream. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haha, weird dream."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I've gotta get up early today, you know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Today </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I are going to bury the hairpin. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Spare me the tiring dreams..."</STYLE><PG>
"I see... <STYLE ID="1">the me of the last dimension I saw</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
The dimension that reached the truth and destroyed Shigatsu Youka..."<PG>
"But why would <STYLE ID="1">the me of that dimension</STYLE> be here..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I heard a voice calling for help, see. That's why I came here."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sounds like I'm supposed to get you out of this world and take you to the world I live in..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Though, well, two of me would cause a riot, hahaha!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then let's do this. You and I are the same person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So we just have to become one, right?"</STYLE><PG>
"Become one... with <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>...?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. Then I can get you out of this world. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Come on, hurry up, I'm gonna wake up."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花悲しい.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama... 
{PAUSE ""}
What should I do..."
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
